  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Two additional floors and internal alterations to provide 5 No. one bedroom flats and 1 No. studio flat; commercial unit on ground and lower ground floor including part change of use of ground floor to residential use ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reason of its constraints in terms of the size of the site, total lack of amenity space, with all the six units being small one bed or a studio flat, and the practicality of servicing the refuse collection for 6 flats and the ground floor commercial unit, represents an over redevelopment of this site by reason of the number of separate units, to the detriment of the amenities in the locality and the future occupiers, contrary to policy GR1 of the new Local Plan (2021-2024), D3 London Plan (2021) and the National Planning Policy Framework (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
